OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny early morning mist patches
OL,6,Fquickly clearing to leave prolonged
OL,7,Fsunny periods for most. Perhaps
OL,8,Fstaying cloudier in the west, chiefly
OL,9,FDevon and Cornwall, but widely warm
OL,10,Fwith light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FStaying clous in the west,
OL,13,Fbut clear spells elsewhere. With light
OL,14,Fwinds, isolated mist will develop once
OL,15,Fmore. Can be chill under any prolonged
OL,16,Fclear spell in the east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
