OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FCloud across Devon and
OL,6,FCornwall will start to lift through
OL,7,Fthe day, bringing sunny spells across
OL,8,Fthe region. Slightly warmer than
OL,9,Fprevious days in light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FStaying mostly settled across the
OL,13,Fregion for the next few days, with
OL,14,Fsunny spells. Over night temperatures
OL,15,Fwill be low, but daytime temperatures
OL,16,Freturning to average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
